{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/page,_N_T_/,_N_T_/index"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/__PAGE__"],"prefetchHints":{"hints":64,"slots":{"children":{"hints":160,"slots":null}}}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" imageSrcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fupload%2Flogo.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fupload%2Flogo.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 2x\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/2l4knl18nkk99.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/2xifrx2245bdj.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/29lt_7kjcgsbm.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1bf_emru8h_uh.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-3xgkxwkcrbtcm.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/44oxwbh__ebkl.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1nd9dzizs0rrr.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-YYVPXWZLF8\" as=\"script\"/><title>Readora | Translate Manga, Manhwa, and Manhua Images</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Readora helps you translate manga, manhwa, and manhua from images with a simple online reader and editor.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.2pbofowy9xkbn.ico\" sizes=\"303x274\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><meta name=\"google-adsense-account\" content=\"ca-pub-3558900564632115\"/><meta name=\"google-site-verification\" content=\"3Rki2vSPK39LR6h_QEZh9t96z4Z4ZVV06PZiYW_6kiY\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"hidden\">Readora được duy trì bằng quảng cáo để giữ web hoạt động miễn phí. Nếu quảng cáo hữu ích với bạn, hãy cân nhắc ủng hộ bằng cách tương tác với chúng. Cảm ơn bạn ❤️ Ads help keep Readora free and running for everyone ❤️</div><main class=\"min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden bg-black text-white\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top,rgba(120,119,198,0.15),transparent_40%)]\"></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-4 sm:py-5 md:px-8 md:py-6\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/70 text-zinc-100\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white text-black\"><img alt=\"Readora logo\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-7 w-7 object-contain\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fupload%2Flogo.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fupload%2Flogo.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fupload%2Flogo.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75\"/></div><div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\">Readora</div><div class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400\">Đọc truyện dễ dàng hơn</div></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold border-zinc-700 bg-zinc-900/70 text-zinc-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sun h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M12 20v2\"></path><path d=\"m4.93 4.93 1.41 1.41\"></path><path d=\"m17.66 17.66 1.41 1.41\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 12h2\"></path><path d=\"m6.34 17.66-1.41 1.41\"></path><path d=\"m19.07 4.93-1.41 1.41\"></path></svg>Chế độ sáng</button></div><div class=\"mb-5 text-center sm:mb-6\"><p class=\"mx-auto max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed sm:text-base text-zinc-400\">Tải lên các trang manga, manhwa hoặc manhua, quét từng khung thoại và dịch trực tiếp trên hình ảnh.</p><div class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl rounded-2xl border px-4 py-3 text-sm leading-relaxed sm:mt-5 border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/60 text-zinc-300\">Support • Contact • Feedback: <!-- --> <a href=\"mailto:tranthanhnguyenviet@gmail.com\" class=\"font-semibold underline underline-offset-4 text-white\">tranthanhnguyenviet@gmail.com</a></div></div><div class=\"mb-4 flex justify-center sm:mb-5\"><div class=\"inline-flex w-full max-w-md flex-wrap rounded-full p-1 sm:w-auto border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/70\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex-1 rounded-full px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold sm:flex-none bg-white text-black\">Hình ảnh</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex-1 rounded-full px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold sm:flex-none text-zinc-300\">Văn bản</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex-1 rounded-full px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold sm:flex-none text-zinc-300\">Lịch sử</button></div></div><div class=\"grid items-start gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[320px_minmax(0,1fr)] xl:grid-cols-[360px_minmax(0,1fr)] xl:gap-8\"><div class=\"min-w-0 w-full space-y-4\"><div class=\"rounded-3xl border p-4 backdrop-blur sm:p-6 border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/70\"><div class=\"mb-3 text-sm font-semibold\">Lấy ảnh từ URL</div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row\"><input type=\"url\" placeholder=\"Nhập URL từ Webtoon hoặc MangaDex\" class=\"flex-1 rounded-xl border px-4 py-2 text-sm outline-none border-zinc-700 bg-black/40 text-white placeholder:text-zinc-500\" value=\"\"/><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-xl px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold whitespace-nowrap transition disabled:opacity-50 bg-white text-black hover:bg-zinc-200\">Lấy ảnh</button></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-zinc-400\">Hiện chỉ hỗ trợ link từ Webtoon và MangaDex</p></div><div class=\"relative min-w-0 w-full max-w-full overflow-x-clip rounded-3xl border p-3 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur sm:p-4 xl:sticky xl:top-6 border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/70 shadow-black/30\"><label class=\"flex min-h-[165px] w-full min-w-0 max-w-full cursor-pointer flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-3xl border-2 border-dashed px-4 py-5 text-center transition sm:px-6 border-zinc-700 hover:border-zinc-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-upload mb-3 h-8 w-8 sm:h-10 sm:w-10\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3v12\"></path><path d=\"m17 8-5-5-5 5\"></path><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path></svg><div class=\"mb-1 text-sm font-semibold sm:text-base\">Tải ảnh lên</div><div class=\"max-w-[18rem] text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-400\">Nhấn để chọn ảnh hoặc kéo thả nhiều trang truyện vào đây. Hỗ trợ PNG, JPG và WEBP.</div><input type=\"file\" multiple=\"\" accept=\"image/*\" class=\"hidden\"/></label><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4\"><div class=\"grid min-w-0 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-1\"><div class=\"relative min-w-0 w-full\"><label class=\"mb-2 block text-sm text-zinc-400\">Ngôn ngữ gốc</label><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex w-full min-w-0 items-center justify-between rounded-2xl border px-4 py-3 text-left outline-none border-zinc-700 bg-zinc-800 text-white\"><span class=\"min-w-0 truncate\">Tiếng Anh</span><span class=\"ml-3 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xs lowercase opacity-50\">us</span><span class=\"text-xs opacity-60\">⌄</span></span></button></div><div class=\"relative min-w-0 w-full\"><label class=\"mb-2 block text-sm text-zinc-400\">Dịch sang</label><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex w-full min-w-0 items-center justify-between rounded-2xl border px-4 py-3 text-left outline-none border-zinc-700 bg-zinc-800 text-white\"><span class=\"min-w-0 truncate\">Tiếng Việt</span><span class=\"ml-3 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xs lowercase opacity-50\">vn</span><span class=\"text-xs opacity-60\">⌄</span></span></button></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border p-3 border-zinc-800 bg-black/20\"><div class=\"mb-2 text-sm font-semibold\">Quét OCR thử nghiệm</div><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-400\">Quét từng đoạn theo chiều cao đã chọn và ghi text/bounding box vào Console (F12). Bước này chưa dịch.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><label class=\"flex-1 text-xs\">Cao mỗi vùng (px)<input type=\"number\" min=\"400\" max=\"6000\" step=\"100\" class=\"mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 text-sm outline-none border-zinc-700 bg-zinc-800 text-white\" value=\"800\"/></label><button type=\"button\" disabled=\"\" class=\"mt-5 rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold transition disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 bg-white text-black hover:bg-zinc-200\">Quét OCR</button></div><button type=\"button\" disabled=\"\" class=\"mt-2 w-full rounded-xl border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold transition disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 border-zinc-700 text-zinc-200 hover:bg-zinc-800\">GG Lens</button></div></div></div></div><div class=\"min-w-0 space-y-6 xl:space-y-8\"><div class=\"relative min-h-[360px] overflow-auto rounded-3xl border p-3 backdrop-blur sm:min-h-[520px] sm:p-4 lg:min-h-[800px] border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/70\"><div class=\"flex h-[280px] flex-col items-center justify-center text-center text-zinc-500 sm:h-[420px] lg:h-[700px]\"><div class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-semibold\">Tải ảnh lên để bắt đầu</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Trở lại đầu trang\" class=\"fixed bottom-20 right-4 z-[10001] flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full shadow-xl transition hover:scale-105 sm:bottom-24 sm:right-6 bg-zinc-800 text-white hover:bg-zinc-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2